abstract: >-
  Independently maintained model, training and inference workflow with portable
  audits of available historical evidence. The legacy training engine, raw EEG
  and trained weights are excluded. Validation does not establish full historical
  numerical replication. Component-specific license terms apply as documented
  in LICENSE_SCOPE.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
